(7473273, 1186903, 138630, '<td valign="top">Thanks to those who commented - Johanna got it right, I think.  Very dark in there so ISO up and shutter slow and aperture open - should have opted for even higher ISO though.  I have another, a bit closer and with much better focus, but I cut his paws off.  I was able to put them in acceptably from another file, but couldn''t use it here :(</td>', 'Thanks to those who commented - Johanna got it right, I think.  Very dark in there so ISO up and shutter slow and aperture open - should have opted for even higher ISO though.  I have another, a bit closer and with much better focus, but I cut his paws off.  I was able to put them in acceptably from another file, but couldn''t use it here :(', '2016-09-08 16:45:20.000000', NULL, 0),
