(7473433, 1186689, 114285, '<td valign="top">Oh this was you! Yes I do have to agree with the processing. What I can''t get over is how many are   trying to take a photo of a moving dolphin with a phone...I guess not  everyone has a fancy camera with a zoom lens.    <br/> <br/>Sure you had some other killer shots,  how could you not take them at such a beautiful place like this!</td>', 'Oh this was you! Yes I do have to agree with the processing. What I can''t get over is how many are   trying to take a photo of a moving dolphin with a phone...I guess not  everyone has a fancy camera with a zoom lens.     Sure you had some other killer shots,  how could you not take them at such a beautiful place like this!', '2016-09-09 04:55:21.000000', NULL, 0),
