(7474419, 1186903, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great composition choice, the paws do have a special quality. I would have thought that with your PP''ing skill you could have enhanced the soft focus into a "baby super-predator portraits" kid of thing, but perhaps that is tougher to do with a more "motion" feeling blur.</td>', 'Great composition choice, the paws do have a special quality. I would have thought that with your PP''ing skill you could have enhanced the soft focus into a "baby super-predator portraits" kid of thing, but perhaps that is tougher to do with a more "motion" feeling blur.', '2016-09-17 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7474420, 1186390, 12611, '<td valign="top">I''m torn between reconciling the focus with the really nice effect and subtle drawing of the viewer to the whites of the eyes.</td>', 'I''m torn between reconciling the focus with the really nice effect and subtle drawing of the viewer to the whites of the eyes.', '2016-09-17 14:28:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7478089, 1186848, 98565, '<td valign="top">I like this picture - actually a lot. It tells the story of a musician who is working at a tourist spot, smiling, posing with tourists in front of countless mobile phones, tootling always the same melodies. But he never losses his good mood and humour! Or is he part of a band? I hope he gets some appropriate fee!<br/> <br/>My only thing I want to gripe about is that the backpipe is cropped on the right, while there is plenty of room on the left side.<br/>And, sorry, I really don''t know: what does SooC mean?</td>', 'I like this picture - actually a lot. It tells the story of a musician who is working at a tourist spot, smiling, posing with tourists in front of countless mobile phones, tootling always the same melodies. But he never losses his good mood and humour! Or is he part of a band? I hope he gets some appropriate fee! My only thing I want to gripe about is that the backpipe is cropped on the right, while there is plenty of room on the left side.And, sorry, I really don''t know: what does SooC mean?', '2016-10-11 13:03:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7483819, 1186822, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like the intemecy</td>', 'I like the intemecy', '2016-11-23 03:41:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7573059, 1186898, 28742, '<td valign="top">This is spectacular.</td>', 'This is spectacular.', '2018-06-22 20:03:37.000000', NULL, 0);
